B.ayA=new A.mM("Collection sync","Your collection is kept on this device and synced to your account, so it follows you to other phones. Changes made offline wait here and upload when you are back online.",B.avZ,null,null)
B.O8=new A.mM("Pushing the schedule","You can move registration close and the start later until the first matches are generated.\n\nPush registration: the start moves by the same amount, so players keep the same gap between registration closing and the first round. You can turn that off if the start should stay put.\n\nPush start: only the start moves.\n\nTimes only move later, never earlier. Once matches exist the schedule is locked.",null,null,null)
B.ayB=new A.mM("Your tests","Tests are saved on this device only. Every battle you record is saved right away, so nothing is lost if the app closes.\n\nBackup (the cloud button) uploads a private copy to your account, so you can restore your tests on another phone. Nobody else can see them.",B.pK,null,null)
B.atK=new A.a3(58245,"MaterialIcons",null,!0)
B.ayF=new A.mM("Battle log","Newest first. Each battle keeps the exact builds, stadium, launchers and side it was recorded with, so changing your setup later never changes old battles.\n\nTap a battle to fix its result, side or note.",B.atK,null,null)
B.ayI=new A.mM("How to read these bars",'Bars are relative to this part\'s own highest stat, not to every part in the game, so they show the shape of a part rather than its absolute power. A range like "30 \u2013 55" is a two-stat part whose value depends on how it is used.',null,null,null)
B.ayJ=new A.mM("Scoring","Spin finish 1 point, Over finish 2, Burst finish 2, Xtreme finish 3. A draw scores nothing.\n\nEvery battle is saved on this device the moment you tap it.",B.Ns,null,null)
B.ayM=new A.mM("How testing works","Add an opponent, then record each battle: who won and how (Spin 1, Over 2, Burst 2, Xtreme 3 points), or a draw. Each battle keeps both builds by their part ids, plus the stadium, launchers and your launch side. Records and stats are worked out from the battles you recorded.\n\nEverything is saved on this device as you go.",B.pK,null,null)
